WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:01.740
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:02.740
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.330
Welcome to part 2 of Ping Pong Street Battles!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:08.269
We will be challenging people on the streets

00:00:08.269 --> 00:00:10.300
With these items.

00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:13.879
We'll play a game of table tennis to 11 points

00:00:13.879 --> 00:00:15.469
Our opponent gets to choose

00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:17.250
Which item we will play with.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:19.860
If they beat us, they will get 20 euros.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.420
Let's go!

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:59.780
Thanks for watching guys, hope you enjoyed
this episode!

00:09:59.920 --> 00:10:02.460
With today's items we managed to beat all
our challengers.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:05.220
Comment below which items we should use in
our next episode

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:07.520
And remember to like and subscribe.

00:10:07.529 --> 00:10:08.240
Until next time!

